Dialogue: 3,0:01:14.22,0:01:16.68,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}却要道一声别
Dialogue: 3,0:01:17.18,0:01:20.31,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,120)}我闪闪发光
Dialogue: 3,0:01:22.40,0:01:23.31,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}抬起头看看吧
Dialogue: 3,0:01:23.31,0:01:25.48,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,240)\an3\pos(1850,975)}抬起头看看吧
